Z||000000||TRiAD||11-06-2001||11:58 PM||||<B><u><I>Car:</I></u></B> 1985 Pontiac Fiero GT, 2.8 V6 4sp manual<P>Bought from 85ZainoGT (Paul Ventimiglia).<BR>Miles are unknown (unbeknownst to me until I had paid for the car  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"> ; the only drawback of the day), but the car is in very good condition. Ran the 220+ miles home with no problem (and got almost 30mpg@85mph!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/eek.gif"> ), and needs little except a headliner, rear fascia, and trim maintenance.<P>For the $2,150 I paid, I feel like I got a good deal. Now...ON TO MODDING! WOOHOO!!!!<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://communities.msn.com/_Secure/0OAB0cA0SYNWUPTvE4cNXuKEOF6RDX3eJl9YyFA7XY5h04u1up4JPKIT3evpoOjgByKPUFHobfre9t5XUrPCpmnQAcAA6AC8A/85-Sig-2.gif">             <BR><B><I><u><FONT COLOR="red">TRiAD Motorsports</FONT></u></B> \\\\ <B>triadtuning@hotmail.com</B> //// Michael ~ 85 GT 4sp</I>||||reg||1
