Z||000017||TRiAD||11-08-2001||12:57 AM||||Thanks all!<P>I will be mounting Archie's NACA ducts as soon as they arrive (the pass side one first, for the pics here), and will probably leave it alone till spring, but I'll be buying stuff and storing the parts till then. (I'm trying to sell the factory GT wing to get the IRM/RMS IMSA spoiler, unless someone has the IMSA spoiler for sale used/cheap).<P>I'll be looking for the IMSA spoiler, IRM-style Rockers, a "Mopar Six-pack" decklid vent, some kind of (small, flush) hood vent, the IRM/RMS chin spoiler, cross-lace wheels, and many "restoration" parts over the winter. Light grey interior parts (headliner, etc) being the biggies. <P>(if anyone knows why my front signals would be too high in the fascia, and how to fix it, please email me)<P>BillFred; how much US$ for the rear fascia shipped to 61550, and what color(s) is it? Please email.<P>I will be driving it through the winter, but I'll have snow tires on the way soon. <P>Oh, it will be monochromatic white with black lace wheels in the spring. (I'll be putting 17" SSR Competition wheels on it later!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> )<P>Thanks again!<BR>~Michael // triadtuning@hotmail.com||||reg||1
